{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:24396010\",\n      \"pmid\": \"24396010\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"第3.1.1节称STN-DBS组与BMT组在6个月时的FOG发生率差异具有统计学意义，但没有明确呈现基线左旋多巴等效剂量（LED）调整后的结果。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始研究显示，控制两组基线LED差异后，组别与时间的交互作用不再显著（Wald χ²=1.12，P=0.57）。STN-DBS的FOG获益主要受到基线LED、术后药物摄入变化及运动波动减少的影响。因此，不能仅依据未调整的组间差异强调独立刺激效应，报告遗漏了影响结论解释的关键敏感性分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:40709562\",\n      \"pmid\": \"40709562\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"第3.4.7节称该研究的分析主要集中于没有实际冻结发生的步态试次，并将其证据归类为FOG易感性相关，而非真实冻结事件证据。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始论文除分析未发生冻结的试次外，还比较了同一批FOG患者后续发生冻结的99个FOG阳性试次与212个未发生冻结的试次，共涉及263次真实冻结事件。研究发现，在冻结出现之前的步态启动阶段，后续发生FOG的试次已经表现出posterior STN高beta与pace之间更强的负向关联，以及high-beta、theta与rhythm之间的异常关联。这属于真实冻结事件的前瞻性关联证据，而非仅仅是无冻结试次中的FOG易感性证据。报告对原始研究的事件相关分析描述不完整，并低估了其阳性证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8627d215-6a3f-4d99-bd19-983ca341f6b1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200231586236Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:02:57.193808+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "afd7457e16d0f8ef335c61853623be906a2191b14cf36a0683c91c38ba573a96", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200231586236Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c37a6eae9b1c137d8db852210af3bded3cb74d0e08ae383c149f8cf5d23af961"}}}
